nical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json:1:{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story-verify\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-user-decision\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-human-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resultId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"0e9a8687-385a-4fea-910a-53a721965ff0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story_verifier\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gpt-5.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sessionId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"continuation\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sessionId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mode\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"initial\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifactsRead\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/team-impl-log.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/004-implementor.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/schema.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/test_helpers/fake_convex_context.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/archive.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Reviewed Story 1 against AC-1.1 through AC-1.4, including the Convex archive entry mutation/query, schema and PlatformStore wiring, shared archive contracts, documented TC mappings, the local test harness, and the configured story/epic gates.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"newFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story 1 scope and evidence requirements conflict, leaving AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unproven\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"human-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"minor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"quick-fix\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":false}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"openFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story 1 scope and evidence requirements conflict, leaving AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unproven\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"human-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"minor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"quick-fix\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":false}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementCoverage\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"verified\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"unverified\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gatesRun\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"productionPathFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-human-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"human-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"openQuestions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Should Story 1 be accepted on primitive-only evidence, or are TC-1.1 and TC-1.4 intentionally still in-scope despite the scope notes that defer finalization hooks, archive API, and provenance enrichment to Stories 2, 3, and 6?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"additionalObservations\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder branch, or compatibility workaround was found in the inspected production archive persistence path; the runtime path is the real Convex mutation/query plus the real ConvexPlatformStore call-through.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Both configured gates passed locally; the remaining blockers are requirement/scope proof gaps rather than format, lint, type, build, or test failures.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"errors\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"warnings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result-envelope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"startedAt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:04:18.275Z\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"finishedAt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:11:32.792Z\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/015-continue.json:1:{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story-continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ready-for-verification\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resultId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"295c62fc-b827-4d07-99de-ef4611b00cd4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gpt-5.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story_implementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sessionId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"019df60d-fe28-78c2-89a0-54aa6e77481e\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"continuation\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sessionId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"019df60d-fe28-78c2-89a0-54aa6e77481e\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ready-for-verification\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"planSummary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Restored the missing Story 1 Convex archive-entry primitive exports in `convex/archiveEntries.ts`, keeping the work inside the primitive-only scope from ruling 012: validated the required archive taxonomy, enforced process-scoped `finalizationKey` idempotency, assigned per-process sequences inside the append mutation, returned stable sequence-ordered bounded pages, preserved `lifecycleState: finalized`, and round-tripped nullable related ids without expanding into Story 2/3/6 service or enrichment work.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"changedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Reintroduced the `appendArchiveEntry` mutation and `listArchiveEntries` query so the Story 1 canonical archive-entry primitive exists again with taxonomy validation, per-process idempotency, sequence assignment, stable reads, and bounded page responses.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tests\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"added\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"modified\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"removed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"totalAfterStory\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":641,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":7},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gatesRun\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"not-run\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"selfReview\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"passesRun\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"findingsFixed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Restored the missing `appendArchiveEntry` and `listArchiveEntries` exports that were causing the targeted Story 1 suite and TypeScript story gate to fail.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Kept the restored implementation at the Story 1 primitive boundary only, without adding finalization-service wiring, archive routes, or read-time provenance enrichment.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Revalidated the restored primitive with the targeted Convex suite and the require