sult is revise with blocking finding S1-F3: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are absent and both targeted test and story gate fail. The smallest safe next action is to continue the existing story implementor session to restore the primitive surface and passing gates before any further verification or acceptance.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"inputs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"continuationRef\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyImplementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"promptAddendum\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Address verifier finding S1-F3 from /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/014-verify.json. Restore the Story 1 canonical archive-entry primitive exports in convex/archiveEntries.ts: appendArchiveEntry and listArchiveEntries, with the primitive-only scope affirmed by impl-lead ruling 012. Preserve required taxonomy validation, process-scoped finalizationKey idempotency, atomic per-process sequence assignment, stable sequence-ordered reads, related-id round-trip, lifecycleState finalized, and bounded page shape. Do not expand into Story 2/3/6 service/API/enrichment work. Run the targeted Convex archive entries test and corepack pnpm run green-verify, and report changed files plus gate results.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"selfNote\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"After implementor continuation, require a fresh verifier pass resolving S1-F3 and evidencing green story gate before accept-story.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:31:{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ty