d-context id round-tripping, and persistence-focused coverage for the canonical archive entry contract.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"acceptanceRationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story-lead is pausing for caller ruling 01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012 before impl-lead can accept the story.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"implementorArtifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"implementor-result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/004-implementor.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provenance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"current-run\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"selfReviewArtifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"verifierArtifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"verifier-result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provenance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"current-run\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"quickFixArtifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"callerInputArtifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gateRuns\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"verification\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"finalVerifierOutcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"block\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"findings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"unresolved\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"unresolved\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]}]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"riskAndDeviationReview\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"specDeviations\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"assumedRisks\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"scopeChanges\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"productionPathDecisionItems\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reasoning\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"approvalStatus\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"not-required\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"approvalSource\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":null}]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"diffReview\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"changedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Added the real Convex mutation/query implementation for canonical archive entry append/read with validation, process ow