llect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"approvalStatus\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"not-required\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"approvalSource\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":null}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"cleanupRequired\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rulingRequest\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"decisionType\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"scope-vs-evidence-conflict\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"question\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"For Story 1, should story-local acceptance be based on the implemented primitive-only Convex append/read evidence, with TC-1.1 finalization-hook and TC-1.4 read/enrichment service/API tests deferred to later stories, or must those mapped tests and services be implemented before this story can proceed?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"defaultRecommendation\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Rule Story 1 as primitive-only: accept Convex append/read, taxonomy validation, sequence/idempotency, related-id storage, and bounded page shape as the required evidence for this story; defer finalization hook/API enrichment tests to the later stories already named as owning that behavior. After that ruling, run a quick fix for the non-blocking pagination materialization finding if desired, then re-verify.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Verifier artifact /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json reports status needs-user-decision and outcome needs-human-ruling.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Open blocking finding S1-F1 says Story 1 defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment while still requiring TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b evidence.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Requirement coverage in the verifier marks AC-1.2 and AC-1.3 verified, but AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unverified.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"All gates reported by the verifier passed: targeted Convex test, green-verify, and verify-all.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"allowedResponses\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"primitive-only evidence is sufficient; defer TC-1.1/TC-1.4 service/API proof\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1 and TC-1.4 mapped service/API tests remain in scope; implement before acceptance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"block story until story/test-plan wording is corrected\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedImplLeadAction\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ask-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"startedFromPrimitiveArtifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/002-story-validate.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"errors\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"warnings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifacts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story-run-current\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-current.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story-run-events\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story-run-final-package\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/doc