 the shared API key in [platform-store.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts:1985). That closes the bypass without changing canonical archive rows.\\n\\nI also replaced the static-only TC-5.5b proof with a real service-backed degraded-response check in [derived-archive-views.test.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts:82), and added Convex wrapper regression coverage in [archiveEntries.test.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:721) to prove API-key enforcement plus archive preservation.\\n\\nVerification: the focused Story 5 slice passed (`tests/service/server/derived-archive-view.test.ts`, `tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`, `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts`), and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` passed.\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
