on of WHY `green-verify` won over `verify`.** The preflight envelope has `storyGateSource: \"repo-root package.json scripts\"` with no field explaining the selection criterion. For gate discovery across the precedence order (flags → config → scripts → policy → CI), it would help to surface which candidate names were considered and why one won.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/team-impl-log.md:601:    - The codex agent self-reported `{\"status\":\"completed\",\"story\":\"00-foundation\",\"summary\":\"Implemented the Story 0 foundation for Epic 4: ...\",\"verification\":{\"storyGate\":{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"status\":\"passed\"}, ...}}` — i.e. it claimed it had already run and passed the story gate itself.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/team-impl-log.md:615:- Gate run at 00:38Z PASSED (`corepack pnpm run green-verify`, exit 0). Baseline moved 370 → 376 tests (+6: 4 from `review-foundation-contracts.test.ts` + 2 from `packages/markdown-package/tests/scaffold.test.ts`). Story 0 spec intent satisfied on disk.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/test-plan.md:47:| `green-verify` | `corepack pnpm run green-verify` | Green exit gate: `verify` + no test-file-changes guard |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/test-plan.md:48:| `verify-all` | `corepack pnpm run verify-all` | Deep verification: `verify` + integration + e2e (e2e remains an explicit `SKIP:` until implemented) |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/test-plan.md:50:The `test:packages` lane is new in Epic 4 and must be wired into both `verify` and `verify-all`. It runs the workspace package's own vitest suite, covering the library and the CLI.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/impl-run.config.json:47:    \"story\": \"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/impl-run.config.json:48:    \"epic\": \"corepack pnpm run verify-all\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/03--process-environment-and-controlled-execution/tech-design.md:595:| `green-verify` | TDD Green exit gate | `corepack pnpm run green-verify` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/03--process-environment-and-controlled-execution/tech-design.md:596:| `verify-all` | Deep verification before story completion or release | `corepack pnpm run verify-all` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design-server.md:1302:    \"verify-all\": \"corepack pnpm run verify && corepack pnpm run test:integration && corepack pnpm run test:e2e\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design-server.md:1307:The `build` script now compiles workspace packages first (so the platform app can depend on their `dist/` output during its own build) and then compiles the platform app. The `test:packages` lane becomes part of both `verify` and `verify-all` — the workspace package's tests never fall out of the default gate.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design.md:141:| `package.json` (root) | Extend `build` script to include workspace packages (e.g., `pnpm -r --filter \"./packages/*\" build`); add new `test:packages` script wired into `verify` and `verify-all` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design.md:512:| `green-verify` | TDD Green exit gate | `corepack pnpm run green-verify` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design.md:513:| `verify-all` | Deep verification | `corepack pnpm run verify-all` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design.md:515:The workspace package's tests run under `corepack pnpm --filter @liminal-build/markdown-package test` and are included in the root `test:service` lane via workspace globbing. A new `test:packages` lane — `corepack pnpm -r --filter \"./packages/*\" test` — is added to the root `package.json` and wired into both `verify` and `verify-all` so the workspace package's tests never fall out of the default gate.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/tech-design.md:569:- Add a `test:packages` script to the root `package.json` and wire it into `verify` and `verify-all`.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/03--process-environment-and-controlled-execution/codex-impl-log.md:873:  `corepack pnpm run verify-all`\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/03--process-environment-and-controlled-execution/codex-impl-log.md:875:  repo scripts and the Epic 03 test plan identify `verify-all` as the deeper\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/03--process-environment-and-controlled-execution/codex-impl-log.md:878:  feature gate still uses `verify-all` and records the expected `SKIP:` output\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/01--project-and-process-shell/decision-memo.md:147:  `green-verify`, and `verify-all`\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/team-impl-log.md:22:- Story Gate: corepack pnpm run green-verify\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/team-impl-log.md:24:- Epic Gate: corepack pnpm run verify-all\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/team-impl-log.md:26:- Gate Discovery Rationale: Preflight selected `corepack pnpm run green-verify` and `corepack pnpm run verify-all`, and `story-orchestrate validate` confirmed those persisted gates plus a clean `start-new` story run selection.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/team-impl-log.md:55:- Story Gate: corepack pnpm run verify-all — pass\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/team-impl-log.md:68:- Story Gate: corepack pnpm run verify-all — pass\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/team-impl-log.md:82:- Story Gate: corepack pnpm run verify-all —