\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/003-self-review-pass-2.json:1:{\"resultId\":\"9a136624-4470-4e5d-b718-68c926bcdf57\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"role\":\"story_self_review_pass\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcbbf-d80e-7771-a6db-1dfeec7bef8d\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcbbf-d80e-7771-a6db-1dfeec7bef8d\",\"storyId\":\"01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership\"},\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Project Artifact Association Without Process Ownership\"},\"passNumber\":2,\"planSummary\":\"Implemented the Story 1 alignment at the read-model and access-policy layer: project-shell artifact summaries stay project-scoped, process materials derive artifact meaning from current refs plus revision provenance instead of ownership hints, and referenced artifacts remain reviewable without regressing existing produced-artifact or package review behavior. Self-review pass 2 confirmed the story, tech-design, and test-plan obligations in scope for this chunk are either implemented and covered or intentionally deferred to later stories by design.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\",\"reason\":\"Derives current-material artifact role labels from version provenance so process-local visibility no longer depends on legacy artifact ownership hints.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Builds review target availability from current refs plus existing produced-artifact visibility, preserving prior behavior while enabling cross-process referenced artifacts.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"reason\":\"Allows direct artifact review when the process currently references the artifact, while retaining produced-artifact review access.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adds API coverage that project-shell artifact summaries exclude legacy process ownership fields.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adds process-surface coverage for referenced-artifact materials labeling and review availability from current refs.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adds review-route coverage for a later process reviewing an artifact produced by an earlier process.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":556,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":3},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":2,\"findingsFixed\":[\"Confirmed AC-1.1 through AC-1.3 are covered in behavior by stripping shell ownership fields, preserving process-local current-material projection, and enabling referenced-artifact review entry without ownership transfer.\",\"Validated the in-scope test-plan obligations with added server coverage for shell summary shape, current-material reference behavior, and cross-process referenced review access.\",\"Caught and fixed the temporary integration regression from a too-narrow current-ref-only reviewability rule, then re-ran both story and epic gates successfully.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Proceed to verification, focusing on cross-process artifact reference behavior in the project shell, process materials, and review entry paths before starting Story 2 write-path realignment.\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/006-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"blocked\",\"outcome\":\"block\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"f87102e1-1e54-40dd-b345-9cc79f384c99\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc31-a561-72a3-aea4-bfeecee1f4ad\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc31-a561-72a3-aea4-bfeecee1f4ad\",\"storyId\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Reopen and Degraded Provenance States\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-project-and-process-shell.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/001-implementor.json\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/progress/006-verify.status.json\",\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/browser-api/review-workspace-api.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-work-surface.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/process-work-surface.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 5 against the story, full tech-design set, test plan, current onboarding baseline, review/package client and server code paths, process materials read path, and the main server/client/integration tests for reopen, degraded provenance, and error-classification behavior.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Stale package-member selections collapse the review workspace instead of reloading bounded degraded state\",\"evidence\":\"The client already has a workspace-reload fallback for stale artifact-version selections (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1019-1065`, `1188-1238`), but `selectPackageMember()` does not use it. On any `ApiRequestError` from `GET /review/packages/:packageId?memberId=...`, it patches `reviewWorkspace.error` directly (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1266-1352`). The server intentionally returns `404 PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` for an explicit stale member (`apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts:393-410`; covered by `tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts:557-585`), while workspace bootstrap intentionally preserves the package shell with `target.status: 'ready'` and `selectedMember.status: 'unavailable'` (`tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts:868-901`). Because `apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts:223-235` treats any `reviewWorkspace.error` as a page-level failure, the stale-member click path hides the rest of the package and available targets instead of showing the bounded degraded state that `apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts:65-96` already supports. Existing client coverage only exercises the artifact-version fallback (`tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts:321-390`); `tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts:168-244` covers only out-of-order successful responses, so this regression is currently untested.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Stale package-member selections collapse the review workspace instead of reloading bounded degraded state\",\"evidence\":\"The client already has a workspace-reload fallback for stale artifact-version selections (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1019-1065`, `1188-1238`), but `selectPackageMember()` does not use it. On any `ApiRequestError` from `GET /review/packages/:packageId?memberId=...`, it patches `reviewWorkspace.error` directly (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1266-1352`). The server intentionally returns `404 PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` for an explicit stale member (`apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts:393-410`; covered by `tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts:557-585`), while workspace bootstrap intentionally preserves the package shell with `target.status: 'ready'` and `selectedMember.status: 'unavailable'` (`tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts:868-901`). Because `apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts:223-235` treats any `reviewWorkspace.error` as a page-level failure, the stale-member click path hides the rest of the package and available targets instead of showing the bounded degraded state that `apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts:65-96` already supports. Existing client coverage only exercises the artifact-version fallback (`tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts:321-390`); `tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts:168-244` covers only out-of-order successful responses, so this regression is currently untested.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-5.1\",\"TC-5.1a\",\"TC-5.1b\",\"AC-5.3\",\"TC-5.3a\",\"TC-5.3b\",\"TC-5.4a\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4b\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No material production-path mocks/shims were found in the reviewed story surfaces; fake auth services, fake Convex contexts, and `InMemoryPlatformStore` usages remained confined to test files.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"block\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservati