rtifact summaries and process-local current refs: `artifactSummarySchema` now exposes only `artifactId`, `displayName`, `currentVersionLabel`, and `updatedAt`, the project-shell UI no longer renders ownership copy, `setCurrentProcessMaterialRefs` updates per-process current refs after same-project validation, `MaterialsSectionReader` filters artifacts by those refs, and `DefaultArtifactReviewService` allows review when the process currently references the artifact while preserving earlier-version provenance via `producedByProcessId`.\",\"Legacy ownership residue still exists in the out-of-scope durable write path: `convex/artifacts.ts` keeps `artifacts.processId` in the table shape and still patches it during checkpoint writes. I did not treat that as a Story 1 failure because the story explicitly scopes revision/write-path realignment to later work, and none of the reviewed Story 1 read paths rely on that field anymore.\",\"Repo validation remains consistent with the onboarding baseline: `guard:no-test-changes` is a scaffolded skip inside `green-verify`, and `test:e2e` is still a scaffolded skip inside `verify-all`.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:01:32.568Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:12:51.874Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:24:- `ArchiveFinalizationService`\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:31:- Idempotent retry behavior using `finalizationKey`\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:96:| `ArchiveFinalization