  projectId: args.projectId,\n      processId: args.processId,\n    }),\n    {\n      credentials: 'include',\n    },\n  );\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    throw new ApiRequestError(await parseRequestError(response, buildArchiveFallbackRequestError));\n  }\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
