views |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:691:| 7 | Reopen/bounded reads | Reload behavior, derived failures, long-process pagination hardening | AC-7.x | Relevant sections: Flow 7, Route Validation. Non-TC: none |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:724:- [x] Turns and derived views are rebuildable, not canonical.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
