{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_80","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md | sed -n '648,664p'\"","aggregated_output":"   648\t5. Should turns be persisted derived records, computed on read, or cached with a\n   649\t   rebuild path?\n   650\t6. What minimal structural derived-view representation should Epic 7 implement\n   651\t   without creating model-generated summaries or overcommitting to a universal\n   652\t   summarization strategy?\n   653\t7. How should source provenance from Epic 6 and artifact version provenance from\n   654\t   Epic 5 be linked into archive entries without duplicating ownership logic?\n   655\t8. What pagination and indexing strategy keeps archive reads bounded for long\n   656\t   processes?\n   657\t9. What idempotency strategy prevents duplicate archive entries when completion\n   658\t   events are retried?\n   659\t\n   660\t---\n   661\t\n   662\t## Recommended Story Breakdown\n   663\t\n   664\tThese stories assume Epic 6 source-management and source-provenance contracts\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
