tive exactly once for finalized objects.\n   122\t- Raw deltas, partial buffers, interrupted objects, and abandoned tool results do not call append.\n   123\t- Replayed completion events rely on Story 1 `finalizationKey` idempotency and must prove exactly-once archive append behavior at the service boundary.\n   124\t- Compatibility mapping may map finalized `process_message` to `model_message`; it must not treat arbitrary legacy presentation rows as canonical archive truth.\n   125\t- `process-live-normalizer.ts` remains unchanged except where tests assert live/archive separation.\n   126\t\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
